    "pageTitle": "分母整体换元后配齐次式求最小值",
    "pageDescription": "分母整体换元后配齐次式求最小值的逐步解析。",
    "breadcrumbTitle": "基本不等式 · 换元法 1",
    "breadcrumbLabel": "解不等式与基本不等式",
    "breadcrumbPath": "site/senior-high/index.html",
    "breadcrumbSearch": "?chapter=inequalities&section=inequality-relations&module=basic-inequalities&method=substitution-method"
  },
  "problem": {
    "source": "",
    "keyPoints": {
      "title": "解题要点",
      "lead": "",
      "items": [
        "观察原式结构：识别目标中的两个完整分母 \\(x+1\\)、\\(y+2\\)，并把条件整理为它们的定和",
        "整体换元：令 \\(u=x+1>0，v=y+2>0\\)，同步改写逆关系、条件与目标",
        "观察换元后的结构：目标为负一次式，条件左边为正一次式，相乘可配成 0 次齐次式",
        "配齐次式：乘入定和条件并展开，得到 \\(5\\left(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\right)=2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
        "应用基本不等式：\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\ge2\\)，所以 \\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\ge\\frac{4}{5}\\)",
        "验证取等并还原：\\(u=v=\\frac{5}{2}\\)，对应 \\(x=\\frac{3}{2}，y=\\frac{1}{2}\\)"
      ]
    },
    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "已知 \\(x，y\\in\\mathbb R，x+y=2\\)，且 \\(x>-1，y>-2\\)，求 \\(\\frac{1}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{y+2}\\) 的最小值。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "观察原式结构",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "condition": {
          "label": "条件整式",
          "expression": "\\(x+y=2，x>-1，y>-2\\)",
          "tag": "可整理成分母定和"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "目标整式",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{y+2}\\)",
          "tag": "两个完整分母"
        },
        "organization": {
          "substitutionHint": {
            "mappings": [
              {
                "numerator": "1",
                "denominator": "\\(x+1\\)",
                "variable": "\\(u\\)",
                "assignment": "\\(x+1>0\\)"
              },
              {
                "numerator": "1",
                "denominator": "\\(y+2\\)",
                "variable": "\\(v\\)",
                "assignment": "\\(y+2>0\\)"
              }
            ],
            "ariaLabel": "识别目标中的两个完整分母 x 加 1 与 y 加 2，分别令 u 与 v 整体换元"
          }
        },
        "reading": "完整分母",
        "route": "整体换元"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "由 \\(x>-1，y>-2\\)，得 \\(x+1>0，y+2>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "目标的两个分母恰好是完整整式 \\(x+1\\)、\\(y+2\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "把条件整理为 \\((x+1)+(y+2)=5\\)，可对两个完整分母分别整体换元"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "路线判断",
          "完整分母整体换元"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "整体换元",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "showFocus": false,
        "condition": {
          "label": "原条件",
          "expression": "\\(x+y=2\\)"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "原目标",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{y+2}\\)"
        },
        "organization": {
          "label": "整体换元：定义域、条件与目标同步改写",
          "steps": [
            {
              "label": "定义",
              "expression": "\\(u=x+1>0，v=y+2>0\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "逆关系",
              "expression": "\\(x=u-1，y=v-2\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "改写条件",
              "expression": "\\(u+v=5\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "改写目标",
              "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "reading": "完成换元",
        "route": "重新观察结构"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "令 \\(u=x+1>0，v=y+2>0\\)，则 \\(x=u-1，y=v-2\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "条件 \\(x+y=2\\) 改写为 \\(u+v=5\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "目标同步改写为 \\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "换元结果",
          "u+v=5｜目标为 1/u+1/v"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "观察换元后的结构",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "condition": {
          "label": "条件整式",
          "expression": "\\(u+v=5\\)",
          "tag": "正一次"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "目标整式",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)",
          "tag": "负一次"
        },
        "organization": {
          "homogenizationHint": {
            "originalLabel": "原有整式",
            "original": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)",
            "originalDegree": "−1",
            "conditionLabel": "乘入定值",
            "condition": "\\(u+v=5\\)",
            "conditionDegree": "+1",
            "resultDegree": "0",
            "resultLabel": "0 次式",
            "result": "\\(2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
            "balance": "\\((-1)+(+1)=0\\)",
            "ariaLabel": "换元后的负一次目标与正一次条件相乘，配成零次齐次式"
          }
        },
        "reading": "次数配成 0",
        "route": "配齐次式"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}>0，\\frac{1}{v}>0\\)，但两项乘积 \\(\\frac{1}{uv}\\) 不是定值"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "换元后的目标 \\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\) 是负一次式，条件左边 \\(u+v\\) 是正一次式"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "两者相乘的总次数为 \\(0\\)，可用新条件配成零次齐次式"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "路线判断",
          "配齐次式"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "配齐次式",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "showFocus": false,
        "condition": {
          "label": "乘入的定值式",
          "expression": "\\(u+v=5\\)",
          "tag": "正一次"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "原有整式",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)",
          "tag": "负一次"
        },
        "organization": {
          "label": "配齐次式：乘入条件并展开",
          "steps": [
            "\\(5(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=(u+v)(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})\\)",
            "\\(5(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)"
          ],
          "note": "条件整式等于 5，展开式是原目标的 5 倍"
        },
        "pattern": {
          "first": {
            "value": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}\\)",
            "shape": "square"
          },
          "second": {
            "value": "\\(\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
            "shape": "circle"
          },
          "condition": {
            "operator": "·",
            "tag": "定积 1"
          },
          "target": {
            "operator": "+",
            "tag": "求最小值"
          },
          "ariaLabel": "配齐次后，同一组正项表达式的积固定，求和的最小值"
        },
        "reading": "定积求和",
        "route": "应用基本不等式"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(u+v=5\\)，乘入条件左边后得到原目标的 \\(5\\) 倍"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(5(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=(u+v)(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}>0，\\frac{v}{u}>0\\)，且 \\(\\frac{u}{v}\\cdot\\frac{v}{u}=1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "配齐后得到「定积求和」结构"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "配齐结果",
          "5 倍目标＝2＋两个定积正项"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "应用基本不等式",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-mapping",
        "methodTag": "配齐次式｜定积求和",
        "templateLabel": "代入基本不等式",
        "template": "\\(u+v\\ge2\\sqrt{uv}\\)",
        "formulaStyle": "sum-geometric",
        "showPositiveStep": true,
        "mappings": [
          {
            "slot": "第一个正项",
            "shape": "square",
            "value": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}\\)",
            "condition": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}>0\\)"
          },
          {
            "slot": "第二个正项",
            "shape": "circle",
            "value": "\\(\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
            "condition": "\\(\\frac{v}{u}>0\\)"
          }
        ],
        "mappedSum": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
        "mappedProduct": "\\(1\\)",
        "mapped": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\ge2\\sqrt1\\)",
        "stageLabel": "代入定积",
        "fixedSourceTarget": "product",
        "fixedSourceLabel": "已知",
        "fixedCondition": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}\\cdot\\frac{v}{u}=1\\)",
        "replacementText": "应用基本不等式",
        "replaced": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\ge2\\)",
        "simplifyLabel": "代回配齐式",
        "substituted": "\\(5(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})\\ge2+2=4\\)",
        "conclusionLabel": "两边除以 5",
        "conclusion": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\ge\\frac{4}{5}\\)"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}>0，\\frac{v}{u}>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\ge2\\sqrt{\\frac{u}{v}\\cdot\\frac{v}{u}}=2\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(5(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(5(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})\\ge4\\)，即 \\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\ge\\frac{4}{5}\\)"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "下界",
          "4/5"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "验证取等并还原",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-equality-check",
        "templateLabel": "基本不等式取等",
        "first": {
          "value": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}\\)",
          "shape": "square"
        },
        "second": {
          "value": "\\(\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
          "shape": "circle"
        },
        "conditionLabel": "结合新条件并还原",
        "condition": "\\(u+v=5，x=u-1，y=v-2\\)",
        "solved": "\\(u=v=\\frac{5}{2}\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{3}{2}，y=\\frac{1}{2}\\)",
        "verificationLabel": "代回原目标",
        "verification": "\\(\\frac{1}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{y+2}=\\frac{4}{5}\\)",
        "conclusion": "原式的最小值为 \\(\\frac{4}{5}\\)"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "基本不等式取等 ⇔ 两个正项相等"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}=\\frac{v}{u}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(u，v>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(u=v\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(u+v=5\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(u=v=\\frac{5}{2}\\)，由 \\(x=u-1，y=v-2\\) 得 \\(x=\\frac{3}{2}，y=\\frac{1}{2}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "代回原式得 \\(\\frac{4}{5}\\)，故最小值可以取得"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "最小值",
          "4/5"
        ],
        [
          "取等",
          "x=3/2，y=1/2"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
